# STEP 0.3.3 — tolerance comparator (atol/rtol + ULP modes incl. NaN/Inf policy), TDD red->green->refactor

Grounding: roadmap §3.1 (numerically-approximate outputs satisfy declared (atol,rtol)
or max-ULP tolerance). Policy (both modes): non-finite values match positionally and
identically (NaN<->NaN, +inf<->+inf, -inf<->-inf); tolerance arithmetic on finite pairs
only. ULP = IEEE-754 ordered-int distance; +-0 are 0 ULPs apart; opposite-sign distance
computed unsigned (immune to int64 wraparound: -1e300 vs 1e300 cannot falsely pass).

